{"t":"ARKK","n":"ARK Innovation ETF","nKo":"ARK 이노베이션 ETF","ex":"Cboe US","cur":"USD","px":69.36,"chg":5.14,"chgPct":0.08004,"prev":64.22,"dayH":70.82,"dayL":69.04,"w52H":94.82,"w52L":62.95,"vol":8951689,"avgVol":8181760,"mcap":null,"pe":44.77,"fpe":null,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":null,"divY":null,"beta":null,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":null,"cKo":null,"s":null,"sKo":null,"i":null,"iKo":null,"city":null,"emp":null,"web":null,"sum":"The fund is an actively-managed exchange-traded fund (\"ETF\") that will invest under normal circumstances primarily (at least 65% of its assets) in domestic and foreign equity securities of companies that are relevant to the fund's investment theme of disruptive innovation. Its investments in foreign equity securities will be in both developed and emerging markets. The fund may invest in foreign securities listed on foreign exchanges as well as American Depositary Receipts (“ADRs”) and Global Depositary Receipts (“GDRs”). The fund is non-diversified.","sumKo":"이 펀드는 파괴적 혁신이라는 펀드의 투자 테마와 관련된 기업의 국내외 지분증권에 정상적인 상황에서 주로(자산의 최소 65%) 투자하는 적극적으로 관리되는 상장지수펀드(\"ETF\")입니다. 해외 지분증권에 대한 투자는 선진시장과 신흥시장 모두에서 이루어질 것입니다. 본 펀드는 미국예탁증서(“ADR”) 및 글로벌예탁증서(“GDR”)뿐만 아니라 외국 거래소에 상장된 외국 증권에 투자할 수 있습니다. 펀드는 다양화되지 않았습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[],"quarterly":[],"eps":[]},"trend":[],"rec":{"sb":null,"b":null,"h":null,"s":null,"ss":null,"key":null,"mean":null,"n":null,"tgt":null,"tgtH":null,"tgtL":null},"growth":{"rev":null,"earn":null,"margin":null,"gross":null,"roe":null,"debt":null,"current":null},"ch":{"d0":"2024-11-25","dd":[0,1,2,4,7,8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,21,22,23,24,25,28,29,31,32,35,36,38,39,42,43,44,46,49,50,51,52,53,57,58,59,60,63,64,65,66,67,70,71,72,73,74,77,78,79,80,81,85,86,87,88,91,92,93,94,95,98,99,100,101,102,105,106,107,108,109,112,113,114,115,116,119,120,121,122,123,126,127,128,129,130,133,134,135,136,137,140,141,142,143,147,148,149,150,151,154,155,156,157,158,161,162,163,164,165,168,169,170,171,172,175,17